display_name = "The Sun Pans"
description = "A desert atoll far across the sea: broken badlands rise into a ring of volcanic walls around a dry salt-pan core, and grass holds the outer bank. The Concord's charts mark it as the far country -- a climate the homeland never grows. No main-world law applies: its zone id is all it claims."
